    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the cables and swapped them out but the jitter is still happening at the same intervals. it's almost like it's coming in waves. could it be electromagnetic interference (EMI) from something else on the line or maybe some kind of intermittent hardware glitch in the router itself? it's driving the team crazy because we can't pin down the exact cause.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
